6 | isapprox(0.0, residual(x))
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ relative tolerance scales with zero
  |
  = why: `isapprox` defaults to relative tolerance; relative to zero, no nonzero value is close
  = fix: pass absolute tolerance: `isapprox(residual(x), 0; atol = tol)`   [manual]
